  "details": "vimeo.com, nicovideo.jp, and soundcloud.com are in allowlist for video player [according to VRChat documentation](https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/video-players/www-whitelist/). I personally use Vimeo because it has higher quality output bitrate. Host specific video in unlisted to showcase in my world.\n\nWith the recent update of VRChat's yt-dlp fork, vimeo.com no longer loaded, by changing Vimeo link from https to http, the video loaded but doesn't have any audio. nicovideo.jp, and soundcloud.com doesn't work at all.",
